    "body": "That's a good point. I think same-origin should mean same origin after rewriting the scheme for consistency with how we'd enforce policies inside Fetch. I think that's already what it ends up meaning due to how this is integrated with Fetch, but I might be missing something. Either way we should maybe call that out in a note.",
