    "created_at": "2021-07-26T16:59:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-07-26T16:59:25Z",
    "body": "> I am a weak -1 on this as I think evolving WebSocket is a dead end compared to further investment in WebSocketStream.\r\n\r\nYes, I'd prefer to stick to adding new features to WebSocketStream. But the timeline for shipping WebSocketStream is still up in the air.",
