    "created_at": "2021-07-26T17:09:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-07-26T17:09:47Z",
    "body": "> That's a good point. I think same-origin should mean same origin after rewriting the scheme for consistency with how we'd enforce policies inside Fetch.\r\n\r\nSince all the credentials we use come from HTTP anyway, I've convinced myself that this is the correct behaviour.\r\n\r\n",
